<title>USA: WMX Technologies sets $300 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>WMX Technologies sets $300 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was</p>
<p>priced on Tuesday, said lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER WMX Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 7.00 PCT   MATURITY 10/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.714  PAY DATE 04/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY A1	SPREAD +53 BP/WI  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    YIELD  7.04 PCT   CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>-- Corporate bond unit 212-859-1678</p>
